title: Start
---
<<declare $imageName = "arbiter">>
You stand on the starting line of the legendary Scarlet Loop, the most dangerous track in the Neon Wasteland. The crowd roars as the Arbiter's mechanical voice echoes through the arena.

Arbiter: Welcome to the Neon Races. Only the bold survive. Cross the Void Edge, or perish as fuel for the Core.
<<set $imageName = "nova">>
Nova: Back again, Kane? I thought you’d learned your lesson last time. This track chews up amateurs like you.

    -> Respond with defiance.
        <<jump Node2A>>
    -> Stay silent and focus.
        <<jump Node2B>>
===

title: Node2A
---
You glare at Nova.
<<set $imageName = "kane">>
Kane: This time, I’m taking it all back. Watch me.
<<set $imageName = "arbiter">>
Arbiter: Racers, prepare your vehicles. The Void Edge awaits.

    -> Head to your racer confidently.
        <<jump Node3>>
    -> Take a moment to observe the competition.
        <<jump Node3>>
===

title: Node2B
---
You ignore Nova, letting her taunts bounce off you. Instead, your eyes scan the track, memorizing every twist and turn.
<<set $imageName = "arbiter">>
Arbiter: Racers, prepare your vehicles. The Void Edge awaits.

    -> Head to your racer confidently.
        <<jump Node3>>
    -> Pause to steady your nerves.
        <<jump Node3>>
===

title: Node3
---
<<set $imageName = "instruction">>
As you approach your racer, its neon chassis gleams under the arena lights. A holographic interface flickers to life, displaying your controls: Use [Space] to boost your speed. Use [Arrow Keys] to steer. Collect Power-Up Orbs to recharge your energy.
<<set $imageName = "nova">>
Nova: Hope you know how to handle that junk heap. You’ll need more than luck to survive.

    -> Reply with a sharp comeback.
        <<jump Node4A>>
    -> Ignore her and focus on your vehicle.
        <<jump Node4B>>
===

title: Node4A
---
<<set $imageName = "kane">>
Kane: Luck? I don’t need it. Skill will do just fine.

The controls hum to life beneath your hands. The crowd chants your name as the Arbiter counts down.
<<set $imageName = "arbiter">>
Arbiter: Racers, take your positions.

    -> Get ready for the countdown.
        <<jump Node5>>
===

title: Node4B
---
You slide into your racer, tuning out the noise around you. The controls feel familiar, almost like an extension of yourself. This is where you belong.
<<set $imageName = "arbiter">>
Arbiter: Racers, take your positions.

    -> Get ready for the countdown.
        <<jump Node5>>
===

title: Node5
---
Your hands grip the controls as the lights above the track flicker from red to yellow. The crowd holds its breath.
<<set $imageName = "nova">>
Nova: Try to keep up, Kane. I don’t want this to be too easy.
<<set $imageName = "arbiter">>
Arbiter: Ready... Set...

    -> The engines roar to life.
        <<jump Ending1>>
    -> You take a deep breath, steadying yourself.
        <<jump Ending2>>
===

title: Ending1
---
<<set $imageName = "count">>
The screen fades to black as the engines roar, and the countdown reaches zero.

You are ready for the Neon Races.
    -> Try again.
        <<jump Start>>
<<end>>
===

title: Ending2
---
<<set $imageName = "count">>
The screen fades to black as your focus sharpens, every nerve ready for the challenge ahead.

You are ready for the Neon Races.
    -> Try again.
        <<jump Start>>
<<end>>
===